Relevant columns and their potential usage

• PATENTS_GOOGLE.PATENTS_GOOGLE.PUBLICATIONS  
  – "publication_number": filter on US‑9741766‑B2 and later return peer numbers  
  – "filing_date": find the filing year of the focal patent and restrict the peer set  
  – "family_id": optional aggregation key if families are needed

• PATENTS_GOOGLE.PATENTS_GOOGLE.ABS_AND_EMB  
  – "publication_number": join to PUBLICATIONS and return peer numbers  
  – "embedding_v1": vector used to calculate technological similarity with DOT_PRODUCT (or comparable)  
  – "title", "abstract": optional inspection of text

Conditions that may be used

1. Identify the focal patent row  
   "publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'

2. Extract its filing year  
   FLOOR("filing_date"/10000) AS "file_year"

3. Define peer set  
   FLOOR(p2."filing_date"/10000)=<focal year>

4. Similarity filter / ranking  
   DOT_PRODUCT(e1."embedding_v1",e2."embedding_v1") AS "sim"  
   ORDER BY "sim" DESC

